message: "If you use this historical reconstruction, cite the archived release associated with the eventual repository record."
title: "Legacy bioimage analysis: an educational reconstruction and sensitivity case study"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Montefusco-Pereira"
    given-names: "Carlos Victor"
version: "0.1.0-dev"
date-released: "2026-08-01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/camontefusco/legacy-bioimage-audit"
abstract: >-
  Historical reconstruction and educational case study of the image-analysis
  code associated with JMM manuscript MIMET-D-26-00638. The package teaches
  analytical provenance, sensitivity, quality control, and experimental-unit
  design. It is not a validated biological treatment-effect pipeline.
keywords:
  - bioimage analysis
  - reproducibility
  - Pseudomonas aeruginosa
  - microscopy
